---
// Sponsors.astro
const sponsors = [
  { name: "700 SETECIENTOS", category: "Apparel & Gear" },
  { name: "AUDAX TRAINING GROUP", category: "High Performance" }
];
---

<section class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-white border-b border-epic-blue/10">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Social Media (Left 5/12) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-6">
        <h3 class="font-black text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-epic-blue tracking-tight">
          ÚNETE A NUESTRA FAMILIA CICLISTA
        </h3>
        <p class="text-epic-text-muted text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          Comparte rutas, fotos y la pasión por el ciclismo cada día. Conéctate con nosotros en nuestras plataformas oficiales:
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-2">
          <a 
            href="https://instagram.com" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer" 
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full border-2 border-epic-blue hover:bg-epic-blue hover:text-epic-gold text-epic-blue font-extrabold text-xs tracking-wider transition-all uppercase"
          >
            <span>Instagram</span>
          </a>
          <a 
            href="https://facebook.com" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer" 
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full border-2 border-epic-blue hover:bg-epic-blue hover:text-epic-gold text-epic-blue font-extrabold text-xs tracking-wider transition-all uppercase"
          >
            <span>Facebook</span>
          </a>
          <a 
            href="https://tiktok.com" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer" 
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full border-2 border-epic-blue hover:bg-epic-blue hover:text-epic-gold text-epic-blue font-extrabold text-xs tracking-wider transition-all uppercase"
          >
            <span>TikTok</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Strategic Sponsors (Right 7/12) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 lg:border-l lg:border-epic-blue/15 lg:pl-12 flex flex-col gap-6">
        <h3 class="font-black text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-epic-blue tracking-tight">
          ALIANZAS ESTRATÉGICAS PARA TU EXPERIENCIA
        </h3>
        <p class="text-epic-text-muted text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          Trabajamos junto a las marcas líderes de la industria ciclista para garantizar soporte técnico de primer nivel, nutrición deportiva e indumentaria en cada kilómetro.
        </p>

        <!-- Brand Badges Grid -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 pt-2 ">
          {sponsors.map((s) => (
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-epic-blue/15 bg-epic-gray-bg hover:border-epic-gold hover:bg-white transition-all text-center group cursor-default">
              <span class="font-mono text-[9px] text-epic-text-muted tracking-widest uppercase block mb-1">{s.category}</span>
              <span class="font-black text-xs sm:text-sm text-epic-blue group-hover:text-epic-gold transition-colors block">{s.name}</span>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
